			<h1>A librarian and a research assistant for your Zotero library.</h1>
			<p class="lead">Sub-Sub tags, imports and repairs your references, searches PubMed, Europe PMC and OpenAlex for work you do not have, and writes literature notes in Markdown. It runs on your computer, in the browser or in the terminal. Your library changes only when you approve the change.</p>

